-- Scontro a squadre (SPEC §5.19, docs/COMBAT.md), stage 5, batch 1: the kits of the 25 Delta
-- characters players own most (src/lib/combat-kits-batch-1.ts on 24 November 2026, described in
-- docs/COMBAT-KITS.md). Each one was simulated on its own card: with its kit, in a random team
-- against a random team, it wins between 46% and 56%.
--
-- A kit an admin already saved from the EDITOR for one of these characters stays as it is.

